---
import BaseLayout from "../../site/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ArrowIcon from "../../site/components/ArrowIcon.astro";
import "../../site/styles/button-study.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Button study — Mourne Made"
  description="A visual study of button directions for Mourne Made."
  hideFooter
>
  <main class="button-study">
    <div class="shell button-study-intro">
      <a class="button-study-back" href="/">← Back to homepage</a>
      <p class="home-kicker">Mourne Made · component study</p>
      <h1>Which way should a button feel?</h1>
      <p class="button-study-lede">Four directions for the same action. Hover each one, then compare how much visual weight it gives the click.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="shell button-study-grid">
      <article class="button-study-option button-study-option--flat">
        <div class="button-study-label"><span>A</span><div><strong>Flat accent</strong><small>Colour carries the interaction</small></div></div>
        <div class="button-study-demo">
          <a class="study-button study-button--flat" href="/request/">Request a free before-and-after <ArrowIcon /></a>
        </div>
        <p>Yellow at rest, deep blue on hover. No border, no shadow, no movement.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="button-study-option button-study-option--outline">
        <div class="button-study-label"><span>B</span><div><strong>Quiet outline</strong><small>Confident, but less loud</small></div></div>
        <div class="button-study-demo">
          <a class="study-button study-button--outline" href="/request/">Request a free before-and-after <ArrowIcon /></a>
        </div>
        <p>White at rest, yellow on hover. Lets the comparison work remain the hero.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="button-study-option button-study-option--solid">
        <div class="button-study-label"><span>C</span><div><strong>Solid blue</strong><small>Most direct and dependable</small></div></div>
        <div class="button-study-demo">
          <a class="study-button study-button--solid" href="/request/">Request a free before-and-after <ArrowIcon /></a>
        </div>
        <p>Blue at rest, ink on hover. Strongest contrast with the yellow brand accent.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="button-study-option button-study-option--text">
        <div class="button-study-label"><span>D</span><div><strong>Text-forward</strong><small>Editorial and lightweight</small></div></div>
        <div class="button-study-demo">
          <a class="study-button study-button--text" href="/request/">Request a free before-and-after <ArrowIcon /></a>
        </div>
        <p>Just type and a rule. Best when the surrounding layout already supplies enough emphasis.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="shell button-study-notes">
      <p><strong>Shared details:</strong> 54px minimum height · visible keyboard focus · arrow stays part of the action · reduced motion is instant.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
